HomeCart Code Architecture — Complete Walkthrough
🏗️ Tech Stack Overview
Layer	Technology	Why
Frontend	React 19 + Tailwind CSS + Shadcn UI	Modern reactive UI, utility-first styling, accessible components
Backend	FastAPI (Python)	Fast async API framework, auto-generated docs, Pydantic validation
Server	Uvicorn (ASGI) on port 8001	Production-grade ASGI server for FastAPI
Database	MongoDB (via Motor — async driver)	Flexible schema for shopping lists/items, no migrations needed
Auth	JWT + bcrypt + httpOnly cookies	Secure, stateless authentication
Process Manager	Supervisor	Auto-restarts services, manages logs
